        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ cäŋ kä kɛl kä pay bärɔw bia tekɛ duɔl mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. Kä thilɛ la̱t mi bia la̱t. Ɛ cäŋ mi bia koth ni kaaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia tho̱p ni muc tin waŋkɛ, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial. Ruath tha̱a̱k, kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl, kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti gur kɛli kä thilɛ kɛ diw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikɛ thöp kɛɛl kɛ nup mi ko̱k ko̱k kä ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth, diɔ̱ɔ̱k wäli lirä nuɔ̱p kɛ thäk, kɛ rɛw wäli lirä nuɔ̱p kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ wäl wäli lirä nuɔ̱p kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä, mi luɛli rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikɛ thöp kɛ gëk mucä runä, kɛ muc bɛɛlkɛ, kɛnɛ muc ciɛŋä tin wen kɛ muc bɛɛlkɛ, kɛ kɔaŋdiɛn, ce̱tkɛ ŋuɔ̱tkɛ, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muc ca̱ŋ luël",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
