          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä kɛ cäŋ kä wäl kä pay bärɔw bia tekɛ duɔl mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ, kä bia rɔ lëy Kuoth. Kä thilɛ la̱t mi bia la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tho̱p ni Kuoth Nhial muc in waŋkɛ, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa. Ruath tha̱a̱k, kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl, kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti gur kɛli. Kä akɛ thil diw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛɛl kɛ nup mi ko̱k ko̱k mi ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth, bi diɔ̱ɔ̱k wäli lirä thöp kɛɛl kɛ thäk, kɛ rɛw wäli lieeri thöp kɛɛl kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ wäl wäli kɛɛl kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi thäk dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä thöp bäkɛ kui̱ dui̱rä, kɛ gëk mucä dui̱rä luel, kɛ muc ciɛŋä min wen in la waŋkɛ kɛ muc bɛɛlkɛ, kɛ kɔaŋdɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
