          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ cäŋ kä wäl dhieec kä pay bärɔw bia tekɛ duɔl mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. Kä thilɛ la̱t mi bia la̱t, kä bia ŋar ŋar Kuoth Nhial kɛ ni̱n bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia thöp ni muc tin waŋkɛ kɛ mac, ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial, rueeth thääkni da̱ŋ wäl diɔ̱k kɛ rueeth deet böwni da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ wäl ŋuaan ti gur kɛli, kä thilɛ kɛ diw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛɛl kɛ muc bɛɛl ti ca lia̱a̱p kɛ liɛɛth, bi diɔ̱ɔ̱k wäli lieeri nuɔ̱p thöp kɛɛl kɛ thäk kɛl kä thääk da̱ŋ wäl diɔ̱k, kɛ rɛw wäli lieeri nuɔ̱p kɛɛl kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l böwä kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ wäl wäli nuɔ̱p kɛɛl kɛ kɛl kä dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ wäl ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
