              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛɛl kɛ muc bɛɛl kɛnɛ kɔaŋ kɛ thäk, kɛ ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l, kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni ce̱tnikɛ pekdiɛn. ",
